{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:29:25+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "筮灵 SHILING", "steam_appid": 2201810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>加入我们吧！</h1><p>《筮灵》现已发售！快来官方交流群与怪谈同好们一起讨论游戏吧！<br>官方粉丝交流群：<strong>127843809</strong><br>风域游戏微博请关注<strong>@风域游戏 </strong></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201810/extras/363151190308ee97293f37233b6d42fb.avif?t=1791988631\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201810/extras/a604f71c6e230e4ddb490c2e4f084873.avif?t=1791988631\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br>2018年，失踪已久的幽灵社前社长「刘洋」突然发来一条诡异的Q聊信息，将社员「展天尘」和青梅竹马「沈晓薇」引到了一个光怪离奇的规则世界之中。在调查真相的途中，便随着神秘学姐「句萤子」一同出现的，却是日常的彻底扭曲与瓦解......<br><br>玩家将以一名高中生的视角，游走于日常和诡异之间，逐渐寻找被隐藏修改的真相。当平日里无比熟悉的场景都成了被“祂们”所掌控的扭曲时空，或许唯有遵守“祂们”所定下的规则，才有机会找到一线生机。<br><br><br><strong>无限循环的六层楼梯</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201810/extras/890fa5e2321d36b3c6167e1eefde6de9.avif?t=1791988631\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br><br><strong>诡异的工厂员工细则</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201810/extras/453a3c3b633a00210d78f4dbbb4c138c.avif?t=1791988631\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br><br><strong>永远坐不满的深夜公交</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201810/extras/914fdd32ffa6fc08070c62a73f05814a.avif?t=1791988631\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br><br><strong>没有演员的光明大剧院</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201810/extras/1540e61e223d333fd50